p;&gt;svg]:shrink-0 text-sm leading-4 py-[10px] px-3 border border-solid bg-transparent justify-center border-navy400 text-navy400 stroke-navy400 hover:text-bwWhite hover:stroke-bwWhite hover:bg-navy400 active:bg-navy400 active:text-bwWhite active:stroke-bwWhite disabled:bg-cyan600" href="/kurumsal-bilgiler/">Kurumsal</a></div></div></div><div class="flex -mt-[5px] justify-self-center [&amp;_a]:text-[#0a66c2] [&amp;_a]:underline"><div class="flex justify-between container my-2 flex-col undefined"><div class="flex flex-col mt-10 gap-6"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end mt-6"><div class="text-balance text-[15px] font-normal md:text-lg text-navy900">Kişisel kaygı yönetimi hakkında bilinçlenmek için <a href="/saglik-rehberi/">Sağlık Rehberi</a> içeriklerimize göz atın.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative bg-"><div id="form" class="scroll-mt-[10rem]"></div><div class="flex w-full py-12 lg:py-[4.5rem] bg-cyan100"><div class="flex container flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row"><div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:w-1/2 lg:gap-16"><div class="flex flex-col max-w-[27.5rem] gap-2"><p class="m-0 font-semibold !text-h-sub1 text-navy700 lg:!text-h3">Bilgi talepleriniz için bize ulaşabilirsiniz.</p><p class="text-navy600 m-0 text-base lg:text-lg">Size yardımcı olmak için hazırız. Formu doldurun, 24 saat içerisinde dönüş yapalım.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col h-full gap-8 lg:gap-10"><a class="w-fit" href="tel:4445544"><img alt="alo acibadem" loading="lazy" width="200" height="74" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://webcdn2.acibadem.com.tr/media/2ndlbtyh/aloacibadem-logo-002.webp"/></a><div class="flex p-4 gap-2 text-sm [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:font-semibold bg-navy700 text-bwWhite w-fit items-center rounded-2xl [&amp;_h6]:font-semibold"><img alt="acibadem canli yardim" loading="lazy" width="52" height="52" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/message-box.png"/><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><p class="font-semibold">Farklı bir konuda yardım mı lazım?</p><span class="text-sm text-white">7/24 destek veren uzmanlarımız ile <button type="button" class="text-primary bg-transparent p-0 font-bold underline">canlı yardımı</button> başlatın.</span></div></div></div></div><div class="flex lg:w-1/2"><div class="flex w-full flex-col justify-start relative gap-6 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-bwWhite p-6"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2 lg:gap-4"><p class="m-0 font-semibold !text-h-sub2 text-navy600 lg:!text-h-sub1">Bize Ulaşın</p><p class="m-0 text-base text-navy700">Nasıl yardımcı olabiliriz?</p></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 w-full"><p class="m-0 text-sm text-navy800">Ad-Soyad</p><div class="flex relative"><input class="box-border rounded-lg border border-solid border-steelgray500 outline-none py-3 pr-3 hover:border-navy400 focus:border-navy400 focus:shadow-[0_0px_0px_4px_rgba(10,102,194,0.15)] disabled:bg-steelgray100 disabled:hover:bg-steelgray500 h-[3.25rem] pl-3 w-full" placeholder="Ad Soyad" value=""/></div><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="m-0 text-xs text-steelgray700"></p></div></div><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1"><p class="m-0 text-sm text-navy800">Telefon</p><div class="flex relative"><input type="tel" class="!w-full !rounded-lg !border !border-solid outline-none !py-3 !pe-11 !ps-13 !text-base !disabled:bg-steelgray100 !disabled:hover:bg-steelgray500 !border-steelgray500 hover:!border-navy400 focus:!border-navy400 focus:!shadow-[0_0px_0px_4px_rgba(10,102,194,0.15)] !h-[3.25rem]" value=""/></div><div class="flex flex-col"><p class="m-0 text-xs text-steelgray700"></p></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><p class="m-0 text-sm text-navy800">Mesajınız</p><div class="flex relative"><textarea class="box-border rounded-lg border border-solid border-steelgray500 outline-none p-3 hover:border-navy400 focus:border-navy400 focus:shadow-[0_0px_0px_4px_rgba(10,102,194,0.15)] disabled:bg-steelgray100 disabled:hover:bg-steelgray500 resize-none h-[7.5rem] w-full" placeholder="Mesajınız"></textarea></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 text-sm text-steelgray700 [&amp;_a]:text-navy400 [&amp;_a]:underline"><div class="flex gap-4"><label class="inline-flex gap-2"><label class="relative inline-flex h-fit w-fit items-center justify-center"><input class="peer relative bg-white appearance-none cursor-pointer border-[1.5px] border-steelgray500 hover:border-navy400 active:border-navy400 active:bg-navy400 active:ring-4 active:ring-navy400/15 focus:border-navy400 focus:ring-4 focus:ring-navy400/15 focus:outline-none checked:border-navy400 checked:bg-navy400 disabled:border-steelgray500 disabled:bg-steelgray100 disabled:cursor-default w-6 h-6 rounded-md" type="checkbox"/><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-0 m-auto h-full w-full stroke-none p-1 peer-checked:stroke-bwWhite peer-hover:stroke-steelgray400 peer-active:stroke-bwWhite peer-disabled:stroke-steelgray400"><path d="M13.3307 4L5.9974 11.3333L2.66406 8" stroke="inherit" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></label><div>Kayıt işlemleri sırasında Acıbadem Sağlık Hizmetleri ve Ticaret A.Ş. ile hakim ve bağlı şirketlerine (birlikte “Acıbadem”) verdiğim kişisel verilerimin, 6698 sayılı Kişisel Verilerin Korunması Kanunu kapsamında ve <a href="/legal-metinler/kisisel-verilerin-korunmasi/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary underline">Aydınlatma Metni</a>’nde belirtilen amaçlarla sınırlı olarak işlenmesine onay veriyorum.</div></label></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 py-4 text-sm text-steelgray700 [&amp;_a]:text-navy400 [&amp;_a]:underline"><di